  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.97,
      397.19,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "Industry Sri Lanka\u201d, and by that name may sue and be suedwith full power and authority to have and use a common sealand alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      250.97,
      397.17,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted, are hereby declared to be:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      286.97,
      397.19,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)to promote, encourage, foster the developmentand safeguard the interests of any body corporateof Information and Communications TechnologyIndustry (whether such body is a body corporateor not);",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      358.97,
      397.16,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)to act as an advisory, consultative or coordinatingbody for any body corporate of the Informationand Communications Technology Industry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      406.97,
      397.2,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)to represent the members (whether such body is abody corporate or not); of the Information andCommunications Technology Industry to negotiateon all matters concerning the industry in alldiscussions of the Association with the Governmentof Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      490.97,
      397.2,
      526.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)to promote and liaise with other bodies, with similarobjects with a view to fiacilitating the exchange ofideas, knowledge and experience;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      538.97,
      397.18,
      610.31
    ],
    "text": "(e)formulate, maintain and publish Codes of Conductto be observed by the industry and to promote andencourage high standards of conduct, service andperformance throughout the Information andCommunications Technology Industry so as todevelop the confidence and respect of the public;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      622.97,
      397.18,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(f)to encourage and foster ethical and professionalstandards of work and conduct for members of theCorporation, and to take such steps as are necessaryto promote the same;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      252.79,
      448.15,
      281.06
    ],
    "text": "Objects oftheCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
