    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      203.09,
      401.88,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(g)to collect, collate, and distribute information andideas, on methods and techniques for the benefitand improvement of the Information andCommunications Technology Industry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      264.65,
      401.86,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "(h)to interact with the Government or any publicbodies with a view to promote the interests ofFITIS and the Information and CommunicationsTechnology Industry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      326.09,
      401.9,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "(i)to engage in such other activities as may bederermined by the Executive Council in order topromote the interests of the Information andCommunications Technology Industry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      387.65,
      401.9,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "(j)to do all such other acts and things as areincidental or conducive to the attainment of theabove objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      436.85,
      401.9,
      509.63
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) Subject to the provision of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever as are necessary or conducive or incidental tothe promotion or furtherance of the objects of theCorporation or any one of them.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      522.89,
      401.89,
      558.83
    ],
    "text": "(2) Without prejudice to the generality of the powersconferred by subsection (1). the Corporation may exerciseand discharge the following powers and functions:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      572.09,
      401.88,
      620.39
    ],
    "text": "(a)to acquire, hold and develop any property movableor immovable which may become vested in it byvirtue of any purchase, grant, gift, device orotherwise;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      633.65,
      401.89,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(b)to sell, mortgage, lease, or grant, convey, devise,assign, exchange or otherwise dispose of, any suchproperty or part or portion of such property;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      438.19,
      455.85,
      456.86
    ],
    "text": "Powers of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      645.41,
      155.01,
      656.75
