  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      545.93,
      397.17,
      620.75
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The affairs of the corporation shall, subject to theprovisions of this Act be administered by an ExecutiveCouncil (hereinafter referred to as the Council) consistingof office bearers and such other members as may be electedin accordance with rules of the Corporation made undersection 6.",
    "fonts": [
