    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from timeto time, at any meeting and by a majority of not less thantwo-thirds of the members present and voting, to make rules,not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or otherwritten law, for the following matters:\u2014",
