    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      424.13,
      397.19,
      446.87
    ],
    "text": "(b)the payment of salaries and incentives to officers,servants and other employees; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      456.05,
      397.18,
      501.95
    ],
    "text": "(c)all such other payments as are approved by theExecutive Council as being necessary for thepurpose of carrying out the objects of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      512.09,
      397.2,
      580.91
    ],
    "text": "(2) The monyes and the property of the Corporation,however derived shall be applied solely for the promotion ofthe objects specified above, and no portion thereof shall bepaid or transferred directly or indirectly by way of dividend,bonus or otherwise howsoever to the members of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      592.61,
      397.18,
      615.47
