    ],
    "text": "7Federation of Information TechnologyIndustry Sri Lanka (Incorporation)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.9,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "10.All debts and liabilities of the FITIS subsisting onthe day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act shall be paid and discharge by the Corporationhereby constituted and all debts due to and subscriptionsand contributions payable to the FITIS on that day shall bepaid to the Corporation for the purpose of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.89,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "11.All contracts and agreements of the said FITISexisting on the date immediately preceding the coming intooperation of this Act shall with effect from the date of thecoming into operation of this Act be deemed to be thecontracts and agreements of the Corporation herebyconstituted.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      370.97,
      401.93,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "12. (1) The accounts of the Corporation shall beexamined and audited at least once in every year and thecorrectness of the income and Expenditure. Accounts andthe Balance sheet shall be signed by two members of theCorporation authorized to do so by a resolution passed bythe Corporation and confirmed by a qualified auditorappointed by the Corpoation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      466.97,
      401.89,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Corporation shall cause proper books of accountsto be kept of the income and expenditure, assets andliabilities and all other transactions of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      514.97,
      401.9,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be audited by aqualified auditor.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      550.97,
      365.86,
      562.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) In this section, \u201cqualified auditor\u201d means \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      574.97,
      401.88,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)an individual who being a member of the Instituteof Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka, or of anyother Institute established by law, possesses acertificate to practice as an Accountant issued bythe Council of such Institute; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      176.85,
      646.97,
      401.87,
      670.31
    ],
