    "text": "14.(1) Any expense incurred by the FITIS in any suit orprosecution brought by or against the FITIS before any courtshall be paid out of the Fund of the Corporation and anycosts paid to, or recovered by, the FITIS in any such suit orprosecution shall be credited to the Fund of the Corporation.",
